<div style="max-width:640px;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.6">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: June 29, 2026</em></p>

<p>This privacy policy applies to the Klaus Landscaping worker time-tracking site at
<strong>work.klauslandscaping.com</strong> ("the Site").</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Name and phone number</strong> — provided by your employer when your account is created.</li>
  <li><strong>Time punch records</strong> — punch-in and punch-out times, including GPS coordinates, recorded when you use the Site.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use the information above solely to track work hours for payroll and to send SMS text
message notifications related to your work schedule and punches (for example, reminders or
confirmations). Messages are sent via <a href="https://www.twilio.com">Twilio</a>.</p>

<h2>SMS Messaging</h2>
<ul>
  <li>You may receive text messages from Klaus Landscaping about your work schedule and time records.</li>
  <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
  <li>To stop receiving messages, reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message we send you, or contact your employer.</li>
  <li>For help, reply <strong>HELP</strong> or contact <a href="mailto:tkmail360@gmail.com">tkmail360@gmail.com</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>We do not share your phone number or SMS opt-in data with any third party for marketing purposes.</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties except as necessary to
operate the Site (e.g., Twilio for SMS delivery) or as required by law.</p>

<h2>Data Retention</h2>
<p>Time punch records are retained for payroll and legal compliance purposes. Contact your employer
to request correction or deletion of your records.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:tkmail360@gmail.com">tkmail360@gmail.com</a>.</p>
